   $q$Which sentence does not belong in the second paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"},{"text":"Sentence 7","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-bridge-sentence"},{"text":"Sentence 8","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 8$q$, $q$The second paragraph explains how a parity bit works and what it cannot do, and the size of early computers is unrelated to that explanation. Sentence 7 must stay because it sets up the limitation that the third paragraph solves.$q$, 'draft', '387933c9-eda9-5abe-b3cd-1da3644a93d9')
