  ('99b015ae-0719-5ac3-9d6d-fc85ee0e6f45', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$In sentence 9, how does the phrase "this limitation" help connect the third paragraph to the second?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It introduces a new weakness of sophisticated codes that the passage does not explain.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-backward-reference"},{"text":"It refers to the electrical noise described in sentence 1.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-antecedent"},{"text":"It refers back to the parity bit's inability to locate an error, which the third paragraph then shows how to overcome.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It refers to the size of the early computers mentioned in sentence 8.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-antecedent"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It refers back to the parity bit's inability to locate an error, which the third paragraph then shows how to overcome.$q$, $q$"This limitation" points to the problem stated at the end of sentence 7, that a parity bit cannot tell which bit is wrong, and sentence 10 explains how better codes find the exact location. Electrical noise is the original cause of errors, not the parity bit's limitation.$q$, 'draft', '387933c9-eda9-5abe-b3cd-1da3644a93d9')
